Hi guys,

Thanks so much for all of this. What an amazing package!

Jessica - thank you for these scripts! I'm trying to do the same thing for loss only gambles. Did you ever figure it out? If not, I'll post them when I've figured it out.

Best,
Zoe

On Monday, May 21, 2018 at 7:58:29 AM UTC-7, Jessica Mollick wrote:
> I've now gotten the ra_noLA models to work with different probabilities of wins. Thanks for your help! I have attached the code and input data format here in case it's useful to others. However, I was curious if you had thoughts about modifications I might make to capture another condition where participants choose between a sure loss and a risky loss? From what I can tell, the modified script only works if you have a positive number in the "cert" column.
>
> Thanks again,
> Jessica
>
